==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 2.67~3.33 seconds<sup>80f~100f</sup>.
*20 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6~7.33 seconds<sup>180f~220f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simply spam strong anti-[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Red]] and anti-[[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Dark]] Cats. Because of the high amount of these Cats, you're sure to have some good choices against them.

